cy that's how ancient civilizations  early civilizations got religion they'd  see the Sun go up and down and they'd  say see  like someone must be making the Sun go  up and down therefore God the Pareto  principle and Pareto distribution tells  us a lot about how our world works and  whether it's jobs numbers in California  Hillary Clinton's popular vote margin in  2016 don't attribute agency to places  where what we see are sort of  mathematical distributions this is over  their heads I don't think you're gonna  see charlie Kirk anytime soon tweeting  about this but hopefully it's  informative for our audience as well  today's program sponsored in part by  Express VPN unfortunately stealing data  from unsuspecting people using public  Wi-Fi is a really simple way for hackers  to make money I used to leave my  internet connection unencrypted which is  like writing my password on a billboard  for hackers to be able to find and steal  I now use Express VPN to protect myself  expressvpn secures and anonymizes your  internet browsing it encrypts your data  it hides your public IP addresses  expressvpn has very easy to use apps  which run seamlessly in the background  of your computer or tablet or your phone  it takes one click to turn it on and  costs under seven dollars per month  expressvpn is rated the number one VPN  service by TechRadar comes with a 30-day  money-back guarantee you can protect  your online activity immediately and  find out how to get three months free at  expressvpn comm slash Pakman that's  Express VPN comm slash PA KMA n for  three months free with a one-year  package visit expressvpn dot-com slash  Pakman to learn more

